      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corvault !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0072007600610075006C00740020002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Corvault !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 744,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006F0072007600610075006C00740020002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Qu’est-ce que tu veux, toi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 776,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005100752019006500730074002D00630065002000710075006500200074007500200076006500750078002C00200074006F00690020003F00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce au pourboire que tu m’as donné à l’hôtel,\nj’ai pu rembourser ma dette, mais j’ai jamais eu<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nl’occasion de te remercier comme il faut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 844,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Grâce au pourboire que tu m’as donné à l’hôtel,\nj’ai pu rembourser ma dette, mais j’ai jamais eu<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nl’occasion de te remercier comme il faut !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 147
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bah, te fais pas de bile. Si j’ai fait ça, c’est parce\nque j’te considère comme mon égal<U+0010><U+0003>ᄀÿ<U+0001>e.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt comme on dit : « Les bons comptes font\nles bons amis. »<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 162
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais puisque vous êtes là, tous les deux...\nÇa vous dirait un petit combat ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr ! T’es d’accord, hein, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB00720020002100200054201900650073002000642019006100630063006F00720064002C0020006800650069006E002C002000100002010000000020003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Bien sûr ! T’es d’accord, hein, <U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000> ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 2012,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004200690065006E0020007300FB00720020002100200054201900650073002000642019006100630063006F00720064002C0020006800650069006E002C002000100002010000000020003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Évidemment !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 2100,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00C90076006900640065006D006D0065006E0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 13
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Euh, je ne sais pas...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 2128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004500750068002C0020006A00650020006E0065002000730061006900730020007000610073002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu refuses l’invitation de Corvault ?\nT’es malade ou quoi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 2176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000720065006600750073006500730020006C20190069006E007600690074006100740069006F006E00200064006500200043006F0072007600610075006C00740020003F000A00542019006500730020006D0061006C0061006400650020006F0075002000710075006F00690020003F00100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu refuses l’invitation de Corvault ?\nT’es malade ou quoi ?<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00540075002000720065006600750073006500730020006C20190069006E007600690074006100740069006F006E00200064006500200043006F0072007600610075006C00740020003F000A00542019006500730020006D0061006C0061006400650020006F0075002000710075006F00690020003F00100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 64
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand le chef de la Team MZ et sa carte\nmaîtresse sont réunis, ils sont imbattables !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand la cheffe de la Team MZ et sa carte\nmaîtresse sont réunies, elles sont imbattables !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2612,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0011>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2804,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00110000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Alors, on se bat ? J’veux faire honneur à\nmon Brutapode !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2816,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041006C006F00720073002C0020006F006E00200073006500200062006100740020003F0020004A2019007600650075007800200066006100690072006500200068006F006E006E006500750072002000E0000A006D006F006E0020004200720075007400610070006F006400650020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je veux prouver à Corvault que je suis quelqu’un\nsur qui il peut compter.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2940,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 78
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Attendez un instant...",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 3128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0041007400740065006E00640065007A00200075006E00200069006E007300740061006E0074002E002E002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu vas nous faire poireauter encore longtemps ?!<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 3176,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0054007500200076006100730020006E006F0075007300200066006100690072006500200070006F0069007200650061007500740065007200200065006E0063006F007200650020006C006F006E006700740065006D007000730020003F002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 53
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Cette fois-ci, pas de quartier !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 3284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500740074006500200066006F00690073002D00630069002C00200070006100730020006400650020007100750061007200740069006500720020002100100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 37
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’attendrai ici le temps qu’il faudra.\nRien ne viendra perturber mon moral d’acier.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3360,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je ne vous ferai pas de cadeau. Après tout, je dois\naussi défendre la réputation de mon boss !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 99
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, battons-nous ! Je donne pas cher de notre\npeau si on fait attendre Corvault plus longtemps !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 3736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, battons-nous ! Je donne pas cher de notre\npeau si on fait attendre Corvault plus longtemps !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 3944,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 4152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Brutapode ! Maintenant, c’est toi et moi !\nOn va retourner la situation, à l’aise !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 4164,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Airmure ! Méga-évolue et montre-toi\ndans toute ta splendeur !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 4340,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004100690072006D007500720065002000210020004D00E900670061002D00E90076006F006C007500650020006500740020006D006F006E007400720065002D0074006F0069000A00640061006E007300200074006F007500740065002000740061002000730070006C0065006E00640065007500720020002100100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce combat me pousse dans mes derniers\nretranchements !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 4472,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500200063006F006D0062006100740020006D006500200070006F0075007300730065002000640061006E00730020006D006500730020006400650072006E0069006500720073000A00720065007400720061006E006300680065006D0065006E007400730020002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ce combat me pousse dans mes derniers\nretranchements !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 4592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043006500200063006F006D0062006100740020006D006500200070006F0075007300730065002000640061006E00730020006D006500730020006400650072006E0069006500720073000A00720065007400720061006E006300680065006D0065006E007400730020002100100002011400050000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 59
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿!",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 4712,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trop fort, ce combat contre Corvault et Gypso !\nJ’en ai encore des frissons !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 4724,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Trop fort, ce combat contre Corvault et Gypso !\nJ’en ai encore des frissons !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 4888,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’dois reconnaître que not’ duo a encore\ndu progrès à faire avant d’pouvoir surpasser<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nles deux as du Royale Z-A !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 5052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 121
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mon manque de maîtrise a causé notre défaite...\nJe suis désolé.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 5296,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004D006F006E0020006D0061006E0071007500650020006400650020006D006100EE00740072006900730065002000610020006300610075007300E90020006E006F0074007200650020006400E900660061006900740065002E002E002E000A004A0065002000730075006900730020006400E90073006F006C00E9002E00100002011400140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais non, tu t’es bien défendu !\nEt tu sais bien que j’serai rien sans toi.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 5432,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 80
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai encore un truc à vous dire, mais après ça,\nj’veux plus voir vos tronches. J’les vois déjà<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nassez dans notre Illumis...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 5592,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 130
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Je t’offre cette tenue, mais en échange,\nvous allez me faire une promesse...<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 5852,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 81
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Vous obtenez le costume de Corvault !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 6016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0056006F007500730020006F006200740065006E0065007A0020006C006500200063006F007300740075006D006500200064006500200043006F0072007600610075006C0074002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 38
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Depuis qu’on se connaît, la Team MZ, on est\ndevenus un peu « copains comme Grotichon »,<U+0010><U+0001>븀\nsi vous voyez c’que je veux dire.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 6092,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 129
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais nous, on est pas des enfants d’chœur.\nNot’ clan, il est pas là pour rigoler.<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nNous, les Magicarpe qui sautent hors de l’eau,\non les attrape et on les balance dans l’fleuve !<U+0010><U+0001>븁\nEt on est du genre à tirer sur la mue des Abo !\nJuste pour s’amuser !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 6352,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 258
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On a une réputation à défendre, alors faites bien\ngaffe à ce que vous dites sur nous !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 6868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 91
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Illumis, je l’ai dans la peau.\nC’est la ville qui m’a vu grandir.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0013>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 7052,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0049006C006C0075006D00690073002C0020006A00650020006C201900610069002000640061006E00730020006C006100200070006500610075002E000A004320190065007300740020006C0061002000760069006C006C006500200071007500690020006D201900610020007600750020006700720061006E006400690072002E00100002011400130000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 70
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ne tente rien de suspect en te faisant passer pour\nle boss avec cette tenue. On t’a à l’œil.<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 7192,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 97
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a pas à dire, les combats Pokémon,\nc’est vraiment trop cool !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0006>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 7388,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0059002000610020007000610073002000E000200064006900720065002C0020006C0065007300200063006F006D006200610074007300200050006F006B00E9006D006F006E002C000A0063201900650073007400200076007200610069006D0065006E0074002000740072006F007000200063006F006F006C0020002100100002011400060000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 68
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Y a pas à dire, les combats Pokémon,\nc’est vraiment trop cool !<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+0005>",
